{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":62492,"name":"Jakub","username":"Hiimdjjay","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/h/7bcc69/{size}.png","created_at":"2022-04-10T19:17:17.940Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have big problem and i need your help ASAP. Today, morning at 10:48 I was attempting to check my tokens amount on my NEAR protocol wallet. Google search engine suggested me fake website which was looking exactly the same as the official one.\u003cbr\u003e\nLink to FAKE website: \u003ca href=\"https://nearwallet.site/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://nearwallet.site/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnfortunately, I didn’t recognise properly that website it’s a fake one. I’ve used above website and i went through Import Existing Account process, I gave them my seeds phrases and the fake website directed me to the official site and then I was able to put my seed phrases again (It confused me) but I went through the process of Logging into NEAR protocol wallet, everything seemed to be ok.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter couples of minutes I realised that somebody is trying to steal coins from my NEAR protocol wallet because I received an e-mail from NEAR protocol about transaction in progress and secure code. I didn’t make any transaction at all, I didn’t request any secure code. I didn’t want to move any coins on my wallet and few seconds later  i’ve  noticed  that all my money is gone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy wallet name is: jakub.near\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have no idea who hacked into my wallet but I have checked the adress where coins were sent. He has accumulated all coins from my account on this wallet adess: 9ebef819489ae5e6641cc5573740dadc751c35c3ae37c110e4fad8101494e418.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition iam sending you a  transaction ID : 5Bagm53Z6aE9WX7qJir3t5qAPtBVwoiU7BGq7n2QruuE\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex005/uploads/gov_near/original/3X/4/7/47084674117c9bfa6c1e8670f7ad6c2190d07ec9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/a8nD3xMKdWAsbkW2GmRV5hQiFsd.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"277903658_887367792661936_447651629234540617_n\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex005/uploads/gov_near/optimized/3X/4/7/47084674117c9bfa6c1e8670f7ad6c2190d07ec9_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"277903658_887367792661936_447651629234540617_n\" data-base62-sha1=\"a8nD3xMKdWAsbkW2GmRV5hQiFsd\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex005/uploads/gov_near/optimized/3X/4/7/47084674117c9bfa6c1e8670f7ad6c2190d07ec9_2_230x500.jpeg, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex005/uploads/gov_near/optimized/3X/4/7/47084674117c9bfa6c1e8670f7ad6c2190d07ec9_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/flex005/uploads/gov_near/optimized/3X/4/7/47084674117c9bfa6c1e8670f7ad6c2190d07ec9_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D9D9D9\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e277903658_887367792661936_447651629234540617_n\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e946×2048 116 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHistory of Activities on my account down below, see attached photos.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI will be much appreciated for any help or information.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKind Regards\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2022-04-10T19:24:13.721Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1319,"reads":56,"readers_count":55,"score":6621.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":18659,"topic_slug":"emergency-scam-stolen-near-tokens-from-my-near-wallet-via-fake-website-near-wallet-seed-phrases","display_username":"Jakub","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://nearwallet.site/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"NEAR Wallet","clicks":38}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":5515,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/emergency-scam-stolen-near-tokens-from-my-near-wallet-via-fake-website-near-wallet-seed-phrases/18659/1","calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":62574,"name":"Juan Peña","username":"jeph","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/gov.near.org/jeph/{size}/5841_2.png","created_at":"2022-04-11T07:38:01.606Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, hello \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hiimdjjay\"\u003e@Hiimdjjay\u003c/a\u003e .\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst of all, sorry for this happening.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt happened to me once, at least my lesson was not so expensive (It was like 9 NEARs, but a bunch of NFTs).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese kinds of scams are impossible to track, there are just exchange wallet addresses (I have checked the account you post).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI hope I’m wrong, but usually don’t\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks for reporting the scam site, in my part of the world Google didn’t suggest that url.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeing a decentralized protocol there is nothing else to do, but thanks again for reporting the scam site.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ejeph.near\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Kemal\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"9777\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"http://gov.near.org/user_avatar/gov.near.org/kemal/48/9071_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/scam-warn-feature-for-near-wallet/9777/1\"\u003eSCAM warn feature for NEAR wallet\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ethere are thousands of SCAM websites and new ones are launched every day. As community moderators, we cannot warn our members directly about every new SCAM page we detected, so I had the idea for a “SCAM warn feature”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"cloudmex-alan\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"11112\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"http://gov.near.org/user_avatar/gov.near.org/cloudmex-alan/48/31266_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/alert-fake-near-wallet-is-hacking-accounts/11112/1\"\u003e[ALERT] Fake NEAR Wallet is hacking accounts\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis fake wallet request for pass phrase and after transfer funds to an account called bigbank101.near, also I can see that this app uses stolen accounts to found in staking pools for tokens.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FritzWorm\" data-post=\"9\" data-topic=\"11112\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"http://gov.near.org/user_avatar/gov.near.org/fritzworm/48/14427_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://gov.near.org/t/alert-fake-near-wallet-is-hacking-accounts/11112/9\"\u003e[ALERT] Fake NEAR Wallet is hacking accounts\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI really don’t know how could anyone recover those funds, there are no refunds on crypto, it is the advantage and disadvantage of using crypto, money is truly yours under your control but we are the only ones responsible for taking care of it, and of course this tech is new and we are all still learning, so this scammers take advantage of us, shame on them.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2022-04-11T07:38:01.606Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":43,"readers_count":42,"score":23.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":18659,"topic_slug":"emergency-scam-stolen-near-tokens-from-my-near-wallet-via-fake-website-near-wallet-seed-phrases","display_username":"Juan Peña","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/scam-warn-feature-for-near-wallet/9777","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"SCAM warn feature for NEAR wallet","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/alert-fake-near-wallet-is-hacking-accounts/11112","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"[ALERT] Fake NEAR Wallet is hacking accounts","clicks":0},{"url":"http://gov.near.org/t/alert-fake-near-wallet-is-hacking-accounts/11112/9","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"[ALERT] Fake NEAR Wallet is hacking accounts","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1770,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/emergency-scam-stolen-near-tokens-from-my-near-wallet-via-fake-website-near-wallet-seed-phrases/18659/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":62613,"name":"David Morrison","username":"David_NEAR","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/gov.near.org/david_near/{size}/43414_2.png","created_at":"2022-04-11T10:06:12.524Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks for flagging this, we’ve shared it with the security team internally and will endeavour to get it taken down ASAP \u003cimg src=\"http://gov.near.org/images/emoji/twitter/100.png?v=12\" title=\":100:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":100:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSorry to hear this has happened, unfortunately, I think we can expect more to pop up as we continue to grow. It’s a game of whack-a-mole at the moment, and the best defence is for sure education.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2022-04-11T10:06:12.524Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":29,"readers_count":28,"score":60.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":18659,"topic_slug":"emergency-scam-stolen-near-tokens-from-my-near-wallet-via-fake-website-near-wallet-seed-phrases","display_username":"David Morrison","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"b